        {"zh": "我吸在沉木上。", "en": "I cling to the sunken log."},
        {"zh": "我从淤沙里拱出来。", "en": "I push up out of the silt."},
        {"zh": "水里相当暗。", "en": "The water is quite dark."},
        {"zh": "我伏在水底。", "en": "I lie low on the bottom."},
        {"zh": "我慢慢展开尾鳍。", "en": "I slowly spread my tail fin."},
